<section id="about" class="about-section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BEHIND THE MOVES</p><h2>A builder's mind.<br /><em>A player's curiosity.</em></h2><p class="about-intro">I like understanding how things work. And finding out how they could work better.</p><p>My work spans software engineering, cybersecurity, DevSecOps and open-source tools. I write about technology, make videos and learn by building in public.</p><p>Beyond the keyboard: chess, piano, mouth organ, dance and solving cubes. Different ways to keep the mind moving.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru">Meet me on GitHub ↗</a></div><div class="playbook"><div class="playbook-head"><span>THE PERSONAL PLAYBOOK</span><span>♚</span></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Build useful things.</h3><p>Security tools, AI experiments and web experiences that start with a real problem.</p></div></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Leave knowledge open.</h3><p>Source code, technical writing and video. A useful discovery is worth sharing.</p></div></div><div class="playbook-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Stay a student.</h3><p>Keep asking why. Try a different angle. Make the next version better.</p></div></div><div class="recognition"><span>FEATURED ON MY GITHUB PROFILE</span><p>AWS Community Builder <span>↗</span><br />Burp Suite Champion</p><a href="https://github.com/DhanushNehru#readme">View profile & badges ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
